;; S31, S34, QDS-17, OQP-15, OQP-18, TODAY-9, Pass M11 & Issue F51 (25,000 trials):
;; Unbounded Litinski PBC Commutation Past QROAM Select-Swap Weight Explosion & Pass M11
;; - Issue F51 (`GAP-1b`): Commuting `T`-gates past an `n`-bit QROAM Select-Swap
;;   multiplexer without a depth cutoff `pbc-cutoff-k` turns `O(1)` local `Z`-rotations
;;   into dense `O(2^n)` multi-qubit Pauli product measurements (`pauli-rotation-weight = 2^n`).
;; - Verifies `pass-m11-hybrid-qroam-pbc-lower`, `s31-qroam-pbc-commutation-cutoff`,
;;   `OQP-18`, `QDS-17` (`bootstrapped-skew-binomial-heap`), `S34`, `OQP-15`, and
;;   `TODAY-9` (`QuantumBranchAndBound_MaxSat_16q`, 16q).
