;; S32, OQP-17, TODAY-10, Pass M12 & Issue F52 (25,000 trials):
;; Floquet Honeycomb Period-3 Gauge Phase Slip Across ZipperCut Seam & Pass M12
;; - Issue F52 (`GAP-4`): In Hastings-Haah Period-3 Honeycomb Floquet codes
;;   (`0: XX -> 1: YY -> 2: ZZ`), cutting or joining a `ZipperCut` / `ParDiag` seam
