;; PDE-5, S39, QDS-22, OQP-22, Pass M18 & Issue F59 (25,000 trials):
;; Google XLS Control-Plane DSP Multiplier Inference & 400 MHz Timing Violation (`Pass M18`)
;; - Issue F59 (`PDE-5`): Non-power-of-two stride multiplications and linear priority scans
;;   in the FPGA QEC control plane infer hardware DSP multiplier slices (`dsp-slices = 2 > 0`)
;;   and blow past the 400 MHz (`2500 ps`) clock period at `3120 ps`!
