;;   `OQP-22` (`oqp22-xls-zero-dsp-lut-tournament-decoder`), and `Pass M18`
;;   (`pass-m18-power-of-two-shift-and-lut-tree`) achieving `1950 ps <= 2500 ps` and `0` DSPs.
