;; Issue F106 (25,000 procedural trials):
;; Complete `OQP-1..48` Exact-Dyadic Unitary Equivalence, `T-par` Phase-Polynomial,
;; SABRE Coupling-Graph Routed, & Stim-Verified End-to-End Pipeline Audit
(define (fuzz-find-f106-complete-oqp1-to-48-exact-dyadic-tpar-routed-stim-pipeline [trials 25000])
