        'sphincs-plus-full-qubits (hash-ref sphincs-res 'symbolic-scaled-qubits)
        'all-slices-match-qasm? all-slices-verified?
        'distinct-oqp-count (hash-ref cat58 'distinct-kernel6-ast-count)
        'total-matrix-cells 696
        'verified? (and enforce-guard?
                        all-slices-verified?
                        (= (hash-ref ecc-res 'symbolic-scaled-qubits) 1088)
                        (= (hash-ref rsa-res 'symbolic-scaled-qubits) 1364)
                        (= (hash-ref dqi-res 'symbolic-scaled-qubits) 9984)
